                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.72/–: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bundy</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-07-14T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 14, 1920—6
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>32. Legation’s 24, February 27, 1 p.m.</p>
                <p>Has concession mentioned therein been approved or vetoed by President?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
